diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 1a55755..2adacc1 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -6,7 +6,14 @@ In-memory inventory service. `api.handle(request)` maps a request
 
 ## Endpoints
 
-- `GET /items` → `{"items": [...]}`: every item, ordered by `id`.
+- `GET /items` → `{"items": [...], "next_cursor": <string or null>}`: one page
+  of items, ordered by `id` ascending.
+  - `limit` (optional): integer from 1 to 100, default 20.
+  - `cursor` (optional): the `next_cursor` value from a previous response.
+    Treat it as opaque and pass it back unchanged.
+  - `next_cursor` is `null` on the last page. To read every item, request the
+    first page with no cursor and keep following `next_cursor` until it is `null`.
+  - An invalid `limit` or `cursor` returns 400 with `{"error": "..."}`.
 - `GET /items/<id>` → the item, 404 when unknown, 400 when `id` is not a number.
 
 Run the tests with `python3 -m unittest`.
